WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:03.086
Hi Stillwater!

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:04.546
Hello Karl.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.923
Are you having fun?

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.801
Addy and Michael say there's no way my spaceship

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.970
is ever going to fly, ever.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.264
I feel useless.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.306
You're useless?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.434
I thought you were Karl?

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.811
Maybe that's how you feel.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:20.395
But,

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.439
that's not who you are.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.148
Three!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.023
Two!

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:24.858
One!

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:25.692
Launch!

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.696
We're moving.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:33.158
Everyone else says it's impossible

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:34.993
but I'm still going to try.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.412
Only those who try...

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.496
Woo-hoo!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.165
...can achieve the impossible.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:40.790
Yes!

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.084
Woo!

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:44.043
Amazing!

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.086
We're in space now.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:46.254
Wow.

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:48.673
Sometimes

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:50.508
we all need a little help.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:51.551
Vroom!

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:52.969
Mission accomplished!

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:54.596
My hero.

